{"product_id":"just-like-fate","title":"Just Like Fate","description":"\u003cp\u003eCaroline is at a crossroads. Her whole family is on her back, and her grandmother, the only person who really understands her, is sick, maybe dying. All she wants to do is escape. So when her best friend suggests a night out to forget her troubles, Caroline must choose: stay by her grandmother's side, or go to the party and live her life . . . and maybe meet the boy of her dreams.This decision will split Caroline's fate into two separate paths - and she's about to live them both. But there can only be one happy ending . . .\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Cat Patrick\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781405268073\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 294\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45823797264537,"sku":"17RD-1-9781405268073","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68fb39e3a0063_Just_Like_Fate_Cat_Patrick.jpg?v=1761323027","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/just-like-fate","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}